        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Baby Driver, The Usual Suspects, American Beauty\n- People: Edgar Wright, Ansel Elgort, Kevin Spacey, Lily James, Eiza González, Jon Hamm, Jamie Foxx, Jon Bernthal, Lanny Joon\n- Roles: JD\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor, Academy Award for Best Actor\n\nFacts:\n- In 1995, Kevin Spacey won the Academy Award for Best Supporting Actor for The Usual Suspects.\n- In 1999, Kevin Spacey won the Academy Award for Best Actor for American Beauty.\n- In the early 1990s, Kevin Spacey gained critical acclaim that culminated in his later Academy Award wins.\n- Baby Driver is a 2017 action crime comedy film written and directed by Edgar Wright.\n- Baby Driver stars Ansel Elgort, Kevin Spacey, Lily James, Eiza González, Jon Hamm, Jamie Foxx, and Jon Bernthal.\n- Lanny Joon played JD in Edgar Wright's film Baby Driver opposite Jamie Foxx and Ansel Elgort.",
